  - m_Id: 777662471
    m_Localized: 'Entity File: ''Tentacle Colony'''
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 777662472
    m_Localized: Success
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 777662473
    m_Localized: 'System

      Check'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 777662474
    m_Localized: 'System

      Check'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 777662475
    m_Localized: '<size=115%>2. Entity Management Precautions</size>

      - Entities
      may cause anomalies that damage the facility.

      - Use CCTV controls and
      wall-mounted equipment to resolve anomalies. Consult Entity Anomaly Research
      Findings in the entity files for the correct response.

      - For hallucinations
      and other physical symptoms, consult the Physical Symptoms Manual.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 777662476
    m_Localized: '<size=135%>Entity Anomaly Research Findings</size>

      1. When
      imitating Bound Circuit, the entity was vulnerable to electric shocks.

      2.
      When imitating Tentacle Colony, exposure to high temperatures restored its
      original form.

      3. Its humanoid shell was also vulnerable to high temperatures.

      4.
      It periodically creates masks around the facility. These interfere with the
      system and must be destroyed promptly by stepping on them. The masks emit a
      noise-like sound.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 777662477
    m_Localized: 'Electric

      Shock'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 777662478
    m_Localized: 'Entity File: ''Mimic'''
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 777662479
    m_Localized: '<size=135%>Entity Anomaly Research Findings</size>

      1. Electrical
      discharges caused sparks and disrupted nearby systems. A system check was required.

      2.
      If the entity stood up from its restraint chair, physical force could suppress
      it.

      3. When it generated wires around itself, incineration stopped their
      growth.

      4. High-voltage discharges sometimes caused lighting failures.
      Resetting the power system with the circuit breaker resolved them.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 777662480
    m_Localized: "Entity: AC-029 \u2014 Mimic\nAbilities: Mimicry, system interference\n<size=90%>An
      object-like entity captured on a farm in Chernobyl. It imitates humans to approach
      its victims, then puts masks on them to turn them into its own kind.</size>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 777662481
    m_Localized: "Entity: AC-017 \u2014 Bound Circuit\nAbilities: Current manipulation,
      wire generation\n<size=90%>A humanoid entity found in a former Soviet bunker.
      It normally absorbs electricity, but when unstable, it generates wires and
      devastates its surroundings.</size>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 777662482
    m_Localized: 'Entity File: ''Bound Circuit'''
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 777662483
    m_Localized: '<size=130%>1. Possible Physical Symptoms</size>

      The confined
      facility may cause the following minor symptoms:

      - Visual static that
      obstructs your vision.

      - Voices other than your own.

      - Unreal
      apparitions unrelated to registered entities or objects.


      <size=130%>2.
      Response</size>

      If any of these occur, immediately take the administrator
      medication on the desk, shown below.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 777662484
    m_Localized: 'Electric

      Shock'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 777662485
    m_Localized: 'Physical Symptoms: Response Manual'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 777662486
    m_Localized: Failed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 777662487
    m_Localized: Containment failed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 777662488
    m_Localized: "Today's Protocol Code \u2014 "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 777662489
    m_Localized: '<size=115%>3. Emergency Protocol</size>

      - If a room''s stability
      reaches zero, the Emergency Protocol activates.

      - Before time runs out,
      enter the correct code into the protocol terminal left of the elevator and
      submit it. The code at the bottom of this document is updated daily.

      -
      If you fail to submit the protocol in time, this facility will be sealed and
      erasure procedures will follow. Good luck.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 777662490
    m_Localized: '<size=135%>Entity Anomaly Research Findings</size>

      1. When
      the colony became aggressive and attacked nearby equipment, exposure to high
      temperatures stopped the aggression.

      2. The colony became highly unstable
      when its food container was empty. Supplying food through the feeding system
      restored its stability.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 777662491
    m_Localized: Basic Management Rules
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 777662492
    m_Localized: '<size=115%>1. Duty Objective</size>

      - Maintain stable containment
      of all entities from 00:00 to 06:00.

      - Monitor each entity''s stability.
      Use the tablet on the desk to raise it before it reaches 0%.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 777662493
    m_Localized: Incinerate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 777662494
    m_Localized: "Entity: AC-013 \u2014 Tentacle Colony\nAbilities: Tentacle attacks,
      tentacle generation\n<size=90%>An annelid found in the Pantanal wetlands. It
      feeds and reproduces endlessly, attempting to consume everything in sight.</size>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 777662495
    m_Localized: 'Reported hallucinations: visual static (left), unreal apparitions
      (right).'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 777662496
    m_Localized: 'System

      Check'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 777662497
    m_Localized: 'System

      Check'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 777662498
    m_Localized: Day 5
